<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-ALBANIA UNDER-21 GAMES MOVE TO SPAIN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALBANIA UNDER-21 GAMES MOVE TO SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's next two European under-21 championship home matches will be played in Spain because of the country's unstable political situation, UEFA said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Albania will face the Ukraine on March 29 and Germany on April 1. Both games will be played in the southern Spanish resort of Guadix.</p>
<p>FIFA had previously moved Albania's World Cup qualifiers against the same two opponents to Granada.</p>
</text>
